  ],
  "blurb": "A 500 nm strip whose sidewalls step in and out by 50 nm every half period: 300 periods of 317 nm (95 µm) that reflect a band near 1550 nm back down the guide. Offsetting the teeth of one sidewall against the other (the cell's misalignment parameter) sets how strongly it reflects.",
